# Doc Ock's Tentacles' ruling: "If a creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0 when determining its mana value." Bot1 casts
# Walking Ballista for X = 3 (six mana, though it enters with three counters): its mana value on the battlefield is 0,
# so the Tentacles do not trigger (`! Bot1.Accept`) and stay unattached.

